d pints of the irish brew with game  of thrones showrunners d.b weiss and  david benioff while they were on set  in northern ireland it doesn't appear  that mono brew is publicly available at  this point  but that didn't stop mamoa from sharing  some with the cast of aquaman when they  paid a visit to conan o'brien  in fact conan seemed a little in awe of  mamoa's guinness connection  how does that work how does one go to a  bar and say i'll have a guinness when  they start to pour it go no  the mamoa guinea how does that happen  charisma and a commanding screen  presence are pretty apparent qualities  of jason momoa it's tough to take your  eyes off of him whenever he shows up in  a film or tv show the actor also has  plenty of artistic talent to share when  he's behind the camera  he started his own production company in  2010 called pride of  gypsies the name refers to a pride of  lions and a gypsy  as a nomadic or free-spirited person so  the company sees their identity as an  adventurous collective  of filmmakers they've shot a few  trailers for television series  like frontier and they've worked with  carhartt for a number of commercials  over the last few years  they've also made three feature films so  far 2014's road to paloma 2018's braven  and the 2021 release  sweet girl though momoa is the name  behind the production company  the only feature he's directed so far is  row 2 paloma but we're sure he has  plenty of upcoming projects that he'd  love to take on  part of momoa's draw in playing powerful  characters like carl drogo and  aquaman comes from the fact that he's a  bit banged up  we already mentioned that he obtained  his prominent eyebrow scar from an  unfortunate incident at a bar however  that isn't the only injury that altered  momoa's appearance and gives his  characters a bit more grit  after being cast in the role of conan  the barbarian  mamoa reportedly told a friend of his  that he would look more like the  character if he had a broken  nose taking this as an invitation  mamoa's buddy punched him in the face  helping him to instantly achieve his  desired appearance  in fact when you take a close look at  some of the footage from conan  it appears that mamoa's profile isn't  quite picture perfect and he seems to be  more than okay with that  i dig it momoa plays a lot of tough guys  and he certainly looks the part he's  naturally a really big guy standing at  6'4  and boasting a physique that makes it  seem realistic that he can take on an  army of enemies  that said momoa isn't much of a gym rat  he tends to prefer more practical  workouts to lifting weights  in fact the star reportedly hates the  gym momoa's workout of choice  is climbing it's something he enjoys  doing and it helps him get the physique  he needs for his physically demanding  roles  speaking with men's health mamoa  explained that he has quote  a really hard time training for vanity  still looking like a superhero is part  of his job  for the aquaman shoot the studio had a  rock climbing gym built for the actor to  train on  and he says it kept him quote in a  beautiful place  mamoa also talked to men's health about  staying motivated  if you're passionate about something you  don't need pushing  you can push yourself it isn't terribly  hard to picture jason momoa as a metal  head with his long flowing hair and  imposing stature he looks like he'd be  right at home in the center of a mosh  pit  so it should come as no surprise that  momoa has regularly  rocked out to metal bands such as  pantera and slayer  he even claimed in an instagram post  that call drogo wouldn't exist  if it weren't for the inspiration of  bands like pantera  that post included photos from outside a  slayer show which momoa and his two  children  attended they weren't content to just  stay in the crowd however  momoa actually got on stage and rocked  out with the band  he later went into the studio with  pantera frontman phil and selmo to add  vocals to his 